---
# The checks of the root's .clang-tidy, less those the host code meets later.
#
# For now, until a pull request of its own splits the functions and names the
# sizes (OIL 36): readability-function-size, readability-function-cognitive-
# complexity and readability-magic-numbers, which report the long layout and
# drawing functions of the host code and its pixel sizes and ports.
InheritParentConfig: true
Checks: >
  -readability-function-size,
  -readability-function-cognitive-complexity,
  -readability-magic-numbers
